# Film 5 of still.fail in use on the iPhone Duo simulator, in English: a chat that came from Slack (someone there @'d the
# agent), picked up on the phone: read on the outer screen, unfolded, answered; the agent's fix goes back to the thread
# and its asker answers from Slack (story scripts/story/iduo-slack-en.json, FILM_LANG=en FILM_STORY=iduo-slack-en).
timeout 45000
until Message
# (the film once the app is on the screen as it stays: its first frames, as it starts, are none of the story)
wait 1200
at start
# (the computer's Slack first: what Ana asked there, and the agent's answer coming in under it, read a while)
wait 5200
# (the list open over the chat as the outer screen lights: the chat from Slack at its top, tapped)
at tap=row
tap Checkout fails for EU cards
wait 900
# (shown beside the list, the list still in use: the chat tapped where it shows at the right, brought over)
at tap=chat
tapxy 430 330
wait 600
at read
wait 3600
at unfold
log UNFOLD
wait 4000
at tap=发消息
tap Message
wait 600
at keys
keys Go ahead, and let Ana know when it's live
wait 600
at tap=send
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 400
at working
until Fixed and live
at answer
# (its answer read on the phone a while)
wait 2600
# (read a while with the keyboard up, as one leaves it after sending; the list tapped to put it away)
at tap=list
tapxy 560 260
until French card
at merged
wait 4200
at end
exit
